  "sangamTamil": "குற்றமும் ஏனைக் குணமும் ஒருவனை\nநட்டபின் நாடித் திரிவேனேல் - நட்டான்\nமறைகாவா விட்டவன் செல்வுழிச் செல்க\nஅறைகடல்சூழ் வையம் நக.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "He who pries into his friends faults shares the punishment of the revealer of secrets. If, after I have taken a man for my friend, I go about prying into his faults and virtues (other qualities), may I departwhither that man goes who has not kept his friend's secret, while the earth, begirt by the resounding sea, laughs.",
